ess.', 'The batch size used for intermediate layer distillation on datasets like MNLI, QQP, and QNLI.'], 'type': ['generic'], 'source_chunk_index': [6]}, 'Learning Rate (Prediction Layer Distillation)': {'description': ['The learning rate used during the prediction layer distillation process.'], 'type': ['generic'], 'source_chunk_index': [6]}, 'Epochs for intermediate layer distillation (general)': {'description': ['The number of epochs used for intermediate layer distillation on the English Wikipedia dataset.', 'The number of epochs used for intermediate layer distillation on the CoLA task.'], 'type': ['generic'], 'source_chunk_index': [6]}}
