escription:A field of computer science and artificial intelligence concerned with the interactions between computers and human language.\n']split_entities: text_tokens=4022, instructions_tokens=500, budget_for_entities=5478, number_of_entities=99, avg_entity_tokens=39, max_entities=140, num_groups=1, entities_per_group=[99]
